<div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="Richtext__content PageLayout__content"><p>Master of Science in Financial Management består av syv obligatoriske kjerneemner og to valgemner. Ønsker du å kun ta deler av programmet, vil tre kjerneemner gi et ”Postgraduate Certificate” og seks emner (5 kjerneemner + 1 valgemne) gi et ”Postgraduate Diploma”. En kan også ta enkeltemner om ønskelig. Se oversikt for de ulike alternativene under:</p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><strong>Master of Science in Financial Management</strong>: 7 kjerneemner + 2 valgemner</li>
<li><strong>Postgraduate&nbsp;Diploma</strong>: 5 kjerneemner + 1 valgemne</li>
<li><strong>Postgraduate&nbsp;Certificate</strong>: 3 kjerneemner</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Kjernefag</strong></p>
<p>Emnene står oppført i anbefalt rekkefølge. Det inngår samlinger i emner markert med (S).&nbsp;Les mer om samlinger under <strong><em>Om studiet → Samlinger og timeplan</em></strong>.</p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">

<div class="wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="PageLayout__content CalloutWrapper"><div id="6709e68f"><div class="o5HieFYoWOxBSqBaMxuJ TQWUmT9Rn1I8zH35rzKa"><div class="ASqyfzgRZ5D3rKknUKxU"><p class="XY5TBgqMrRqFYOQ7O7ZQ">Vi anbefaler at du kun melder deg opp til emner du ønsker å ta semester for semester. </p></div></div><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['6709e68f-json'] = {"title":null,"text":"Vi anbefaler at du kun melder deg opp til emner du ønsker å ta semester for semester. ","link":null,"image":null,"backgroundVariant":"primary"};</script></div></div></div></div></section>

                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                        <div class="OnlineStudyPage__studyPlan OnlineStudyPage__studyPlan--legacy">
                            <div id="5e8c030a"><div><div><div><div class="ouu_6Mr8qER3G8uKQXRQ"><h2 class="HqMt_OC8NacvWNmxsueE">Studieplanlegger</h2><div role="tablist" class="oEIbZsTBax6il3oVho4b" aria-label="Velg fane"><button id="tab_enkeltemne" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="tabPanel_enkeltemne" type="button" class="vkWwhSAZ1STJLts894xT">Enkeltemne</button></div></div><div class="_e0fqZ9IPvy_Erb1RzoM"><div class="wGl7I3qLzeXdRbmGTFc_"><div id="tabPanel_enkeltemne" class="GhDfr5Vl17vn5OwwS9Nv" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab_enkeltemne"><div class="qg3lD86UndRCW3THG18Z"><h3 class="RYgRkwoRw1xWtjmL644h">For deg som ønsker å gjennomføre studiet i eget tempo og/eller har en tilpasset studieplan.</h3><div class="SeivH7347X3iE9uttPyr"><h3 class="mzOQ1OlwQPZ8TFejoIpk">Kjernefag</h3><ul class="i5pK9wD7_wYzGZFSZE_p"><li class="urQ8Hdr9YUQBqaZVgHzP"><div class="xRXzAMW6dHstDzPf47Gl"><div class="clSMxUdy2GXaboLMFGTg"><div class="iXNqx4jk0gVY1NTJtTRW"><a href="/studier/nettstudier/enkeltemne/financial-decision-making-s/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm BaRcrU5NpyAMFJiitXyJ _2vfdVZ8jBlNHYTNtan1w" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi">Financial Decision Making  (samlinger)</div></a></div></div><div class="ARMZ02bmizvi5CKUtQSn"><span class="rwVCY5yq4FJavJoTvyp_">20<!-- --> <!-- -->SCOTCAT</span><span class="uP4WwCabcKBqZ3MnxZyr">kr 25 200</span></div></div><div><button type="button" class="yEK9biWpMxeKit4W3SEn qUo0GcsHJo5KTx2OLXFs HdV_AOE4D0H4dDOGneuZ _Bhj18PcL3KoNSZCxCQ1">Bestill</button></div></li><li class="urQ8Hdr9YUQBqaZVgHzP"><div class="xRXzAMW6dHstDzPf47Gl"><div class="clSMxUdy2GXaboLMFGTg"><div class="iXNqx4jk0gVY1NTJtTRW"><a href="/studier/nettstudier/enkeltemne/financial-decision-making/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm BaRcrU5NpyAMFJiitXyJ _2vfdVZ8jBlNHYTNtan1w" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi">Financial Decision Making</div></a></div></div><div class="ARMZ02bmizvi5CKUtQSn"><span class="rwVCY5yq4FJavJoTvyp_">20<!-- --> <!-- -->SCOTCAT</span><span class="uP4WwCabcKBqZ3MnxZyr">kr 18 000</span></div></div><div><button type="button" class="yEK9biWpMxeKit4W3SEn qUo0GcsHJo5KTx2OLXFs HdV_AOE4D0H4dDOGneuZ _Bhj18PcL3KoNSZCxCQ1">Bestill</button></div></li><li class="urQ8Hdr9YUQBqaZVgHzP"><div class="xRXzAMW6dHstDzPf47Gl"><div class="clSMxUdy2GXaboLMFGTg"><div class="iXNqx4jk0gVY1NTJtTRW"><a href="/studier/nettstudier/enkeltemne/advanced-financial-decision-making/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm BaRcrU5NpyAMFJiitXyJ _2vfdVZ8jBlNHYTNtan1w" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi">Advanced Financial Decision Making</div></a></div></div><div class="ARMZ02bmizvi5CKUtQSn"><span class="rwVCY5yq4FJavJoTvyp_">20<!-- --> <!-- -->SCOTCAT</span><span class="uP4WwCabcKBqZ3MnxZyr">kr 18 000</span></div></div><div><button type="button" class="yEK9biWpMxeKit4W3SEn qUo0GcsHJo5KTx2OLXFs HdV_AOE4D0H4dDOGneuZ _Bhj18PcL3KoNSZCxCQ1">Bestill</button></div></li><li class="urQ8Hdr9YUQBqaZVgHzP"><div class="xRXzAMW6dHstDzPf47Gl"><div class="clSMxUdy2GXaboLMFGTg"><div class="iXNqx4jk0gVY1NTJtTRW"><a href="/studier/nettstudier/enkeltemne/lending-and-credit-risk-analys/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm BaRcrU5NpyAMFJiitXyJ _2vfdVZ8jBlNHYTNtan1w" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi">Lending and Credit Risk Analysis</div></a></div></div><div class="ARMZ02bmizvi5CKUtQSn"><span class="rwVCY5yq4FJavJoTvyp_">20<!-- --> <!-- -->SCOTCAT</span><span class="uP4WwCabcKBqZ3MnxZyr">kr 18 000</span></div></div><div><button type="button" class="yEK9biWpMxeKit4W3SEn qUo0GcsHJo5KTx2OLXFs HdV_AOE4D0H4dDOGneuZ _Bhj18PcL3KoNSZCxCQ1">Bestill</button></div></li><li class="urQ8Hdr9YUQBqaZVgHzP"><div class="xRXzAMW6dHstDzPf47Gl"><div class="clSMxUdy2GXaboLMFGTg"><div class="iXNqx4jk0gVY1NTJtTRW"><a href="/studier/nettstudier/enkeltemne/financial-derivatives/" class="XezMfDvRba8HKhHr79wm BaRcrU5NpyAMFJiitXyJ _2vfdVZ8jBlNHYTNtan1w" data-owned=""><div class="DdPYOTimBd1c8zDeoFgi">Financial Derivatives</div></a></div></div><div class="ARMZ02